    "font size" : 11.955,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "In our models, we consider the five exiting planes shown in Figure 1b. To avoid negative bounds on some of the variables, which can affect the quality of relaxations of bilinear terms, we translate all of the body structures by the same vector, so that they all belong to the positive orthant. Then, all needle reference points can be chosen among the faces of the box [1,173]×[1,60]×[95,200]."
